# Optional: enables AI-assisted answers in the Follow-up Assistant for
# questions the rule-based intent parser can't classify. Without either key
# set, the assistant still works fully via rule-based logic (why-not /
# compare / what-if) — these only unlock the fallback for open-ended
# questions. If both are set, OpenAI is used.
OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key-here
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-anthropic-api-key-here

# Optional: override the fallback model.
# Defaults: gpt-4o-mini (OpenAI) / claude-haiku-4-5-20251001 (Anthropic)
# AI_FALLBACK_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
